---
<InternationalServicePage title="Meta Ads & Landing Pages in Türkiye | QCT Commerce" description="Meta advertising and landing-page systems in Türkiye with offer alignment, mobile conversion paths, WhatsApp/forms and consent-aware measurement." eyebrow="Meta ads and landing pages" heading="Direct advertising budget toward measurable demand, not clicks alone." lead="We connect the offer, Meta campaign message, mobile landing page, CTA, WhatsApp or form flow and measurement around one commercial objective." serviceName="Meta ads and landing pages" problem="Targeting cannot compensate for a weak offer or landing page. When ad promise, first screen, trust signals, CTA and sales follow-up do not match, budget produces visits rather than useful demand." capabilities={capabilities} process={process} faqItems={faqItems}/>